# Configuration file for the oki backend.
#
# The oki backend communicates directly with OKI MFP scanners over USB
# using the PCScan protocol. No proprietary daemon required.
#
# Each line should be of the form: usb <vendor_id> <product_id>
# Lines starting with # are comments.

# fx750_fn2967 (A4 flatbed)
